    "created_at": "2023-09-05T12:43:15Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-09-05T12:43:15Z",
    "body": "Yes I think one of these lines is related to this issue. The other line seem to come from a bug related to Clink.\r\n\r\nI think you are also using the cmd.exe /k trick to hide the copyright message and you disabled the logo of Clink to get a nice and clean cmd window on startup.\r\n\r\nIn this case Clink already produces a blank line without the use of starship. If you disable Clink, the /k trick works without a blank line. I think I'm going to open a bug in the Clink project.",
